{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/marketbanner.png?t=1744723556\" /><strong>A Ship Repair Business... But Lovecraftian</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sunken Engine</strong> is a ship repair simulator set in a Lovecraftian atmosphere. After the unfortunate death of your father, you must keep the business running. To do this, you need to satisfy your customers and maintain order in your town. However, each new ship will bring new challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lovecraftian Horror</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/horrorgif.gif?t=1744723556\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The events you encounter while trying to do your job may threaten your sanity. This can make your work harder or attract the attention of dark entities. You must discover ways to protect your sanity and keep your business going.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Goods from Sunken Ships</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/market.gif?t=1744723556\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To keep your business afloat, you can sell valuable loot you find at the stall behind your shop. After all, the economy is tough for everyone. You have a family to take care of and a business to maintain. Sometimes, you may need to go beyond traditional means to make a profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Repair the Ships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/tamir.gif?t=1744723556\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your island is located at the intersection of a busy sea route. Various types of ships will stop by your town for repairs, and it is your job to meet the captains' needs. Repairing all kinds of damage and getting ships back in working order is vital for the region. However, tools alone may not be enough to fix some damages...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604780?t=1744723556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/3a2068095fe8faf94bfcf89cf04307991fa9438e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744723556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/d4d8f746183132d3e974316f5c171a341532cf69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744723556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/d4d8f746183132d3e974316f5c171a341532cf69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744723556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"At certain moments in the game, bloodstains can be seen around. In some ships, there may be instances of finding corpses."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/marketbanner.png?t=1744723556\" /><strong>A Ship Repair Business... But Lovecraftian</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sunken Engine</strong> is a ship repair simulator set in a Lovecraftian atmosphere. After the unfortunate death of your father, you must keep the business running. To do this, you need to satisfy your customers and maintain order in your town. However, each new ship will bring new challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lovecraftian Horror</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/horrorgif.gif?t=1744723556\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The events you encounter while trying to do your job may threaten your sanity. This can make your work harder or attract the attention of dark entities. You must discover ways to protect your sanity and keep your business going.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Goods from Sunken Ships</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/market.gif?t=1744723556\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To keep your business afloat, you can sell valuable loot you find at the stall behind your shop. After all, the economy is tough for everyone. You have a family to take care of and a business to maintain. Sometimes, you may need to go beyond traditional means to make a profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Repair the Ships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/tamir.gif?t=1744723556\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your island is located at the intersection of a busy sea route. Various types of ships will stop by your town for repairs, and it is your job to meet the captains' needs. Repairing all kinds of damage and getting ships back in working order is vital for the region. However, tools alone may not be enough to fix some damages...</p>","developers":["Two Nomads Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/f1b11827db547557b5442c04bb54b38c42af5cb7/header.jpg?t=1744723556","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118362,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118362/movie480.mp4?t=1742904593","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118362/movie_max.mp4?t=1742904593"},"name":"Sunken Engine-Early Gamepl